{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIssuerNumber","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All apps above “twint-issuer39” will always be returned if one of these apps is installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For this to work, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes"},{"type":"text","text":" must include “twint-extended”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you configure any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" below 39, the result will always contain all apps above "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up to and including 39, even if none of them are installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, if the fetch fails and the cache is empty, none of these apps will be found when probing."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adyen\/adyenactioncomponent\/configuration-swift.struct\/twint-swift.struct\/maxissuernumber"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/Twint-swift.struct\/maxIssuerNumber","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/Ady